<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1701566788"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:50.015"><div begin="17.618" end="46.978" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="17.618" end="24.589" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.618" end="19.319">我需要</span><span begin="19.319" end="20.741">工作</span> <span begin="21.264" end="22.678">无穷的</span><span begin="22.863" end="24.589">工作</span></p><p begin="24.982" end="31.635" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.982" end="26.627">直到我</span><span begin="26.627" end="28.108">掌握</span> <span begin="28.639" end="30.002">这城市</span><span begin="30.002" end="30.770">的节</span><span begin="30.770" end="31.635">奏</span></p><p begin="32.396" end="39.075" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.396" end="33.119">太理</span><span begin="33.119" end="34.076">想</span><span begin="34.076" end="35.639">的梦</span> <span begin="36.016" end="38.134">再干一杯冰</span><span begin="38.134" end="39.075">啤酒</span></p><p begin="39.768" end="46.978" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.768" end="40.500">你对</span><span begin="40.500" end="41.255">我</span><span begin="41.255" end="41.865">的要</span><span begin="41.865" end="42.992">求</span> <span begin="43.142" end="43.796">做不</span><span begin="43.796" end="44.491">到</span> <span begin="44.491" end="46.978">不敢说</span></p></div><div begin="47.172" end="1:18.538" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="47.172" end="53.127" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.172" end="47.915">有时</span><span begin="47.915" end="48.800">候</span> <span begin="48.800" end="49.293">其实</span><span begin="49.293" end="49.942">也</span><span begin="49.942" end="50.713">还算</span><span begin="50.713" end="51.406">幸</span><span begin="51.406" end="53.127">福</span></p><p begin="54.511" end="1:00.691" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.511" end="55.329">有时</span><span begin="55.329" end="56.125">候</span> <span begin="56.125" end="57.145">怎么会</span><span begin="57.145" end="58.507">这么辛</span><span begin